Package: rok
Title: Fast Package and Project Manager
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Yosuke", "Abe", email = "yosuke.abe0507@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Manages the packages and the R version of a project. Packages
    are resolved from dated snapshots of the 'Posit Package Manager'
    <https://packagemanager.posit.co> and recorded in a lockfile, so that a
    project can be reproduced as it was. The work is done by the 'rok'
    command-line program, which this package downloads from the project's
    GitHub releases on first use, after asking for user consent.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/yo5uke/rok
BugReports: https://github.com/yo5uke/rok/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0.0)
Imports: tools, utils
Config/roxygen2/markdown: TRUE
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
